{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46096","headline":"和李判官见新榜爲兄下第 · 贯休","name":"和李判官见新榜爲兄下第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"失意荆枝滴泪频，陟冈何翅不知春。\n心中岐路平如砥，天上文章妙入神。\n休说宋风回鷁首，即看雷火燎龙鳞。\n从兹相次红霞里，留取方书与世人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}